WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.322
Start with a small set of examples that you can inspect manually.

00:00:04.322 --> 00:00:10.782
For a classification task, that might include messages about login, billing,

00:00:10.782 --> 00:00:14.812
and registration together with the expected labels.

00:00:14.812 --> 00:00:20.672
A small, trusted set is more useful than relying only on intuition.

00:00:20.672 --> 00:00:29.372
Ten carefully chosen examples can already reveal patterns that are invisible when you test only one prompt by hand.
